WEBVTT

01:03.313 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:13.865 --> 01:17.243
"Make sure you are punished too, spirit."

01:19.329 --> 01:21.790
That was already 20 years ago.

01:21.873 --> 01:25.335
But no matter how long I wait,
the punishment just doesn't come.

01:25.418 --> 01:28.338
You should still be careful.

01:28.421 --> 01:30.840
And watch what you say and do.

01:30.924 --> 01:31.883
Quiet, you.

01:32.717 --> 01:34.552
Why should I be careful?

01:34.636 --> 01:37.013
I am the almighty Genie, after all.

01:37.931 --> 01:40.016
Man, this is stressful.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.496
The smell of this clay.

02:14.425 --> 02:16.261
What the… You're that…

02:18.680 --> 02:19.556
You're still alive?

02:20.598 --> 02:21.891
Who are you?

02:22.851 --> 02:25.687
How do you know the language of Goryeo?
Are you from Goryeo?

02:26.437 --> 02:27.772
Don't you remember me?

02:30.525 --> 02:33.570
It's definitely you.
You've been alive all this time?

02:34.154 --> 02:36.865
I clearly remember seeing you die.
Your breath just…

02:37.740 --> 02:38.992
I'm sure of it.

02:40.827 --> 02:44.038
Seeing those bite marks, it is you.
Gee, you're a mess.

02:44.122 --> 02:45.248
You're being rude.

02:48.334 --> 02:50.420
I'm just really curious.

02:51.045 --> 02:52.130
I'm actually a genie.

02:53.131 --> 02:55.258
And we've met before. 20 years ago.

02:55.341 --> 02:57.635
Back then,
your final wish was my punishment.

02:57.719 --> 02:59.971
But I'm just fine. What do you think?

03:00.680 --> 03:01.973
Don't remember that either?

03:05.894 --> 03:09.105
Dates for sale! Buy some dates!

03:09.772 --> 03:11.733
Dates for sale!

03:18.323 --> 03:19.199
Oh no.

03:20.450 --> 03:21.784
My dates.

03:26.206 --> 03:27.081
Oh dear.

03:27.165 --> 03:28.583
You're bleeding.

03:28.666 --> 03:30.710
You're more hurt than those dates.

03:32.045 --> 03:33.379
What a thing to say!

03:34.505 --> 03:36.007
You tripped me, didn't you?

03:36.507 --> 03:39.135
What are you going to do about these?

03:44.182 --> 03:46.226
What shall I do about this?

03:49.604 --> 03:51.898
Do I fully corrupt her,
seeing as she's survived?

03:51.981 --> 03:53.858
Oh my, what a waste.

03:57.654 --> 03:59.864
I asked what you're going to do
about all these.

04:09.082 --> 04:11.459
How about this? Payment for the dates.

04:29.435 --> 04:31.521
These are on the house.

04:32.522 --> 04:33.648
I hope you enjoy them.

04:35.650 --> 04:36.651
Dates for sale!

04:38.069 --> 04:39.320
Buy some dates!

04:39.404 --> 04:42.490
Just look at you.
You're well on your way to corruption.

04:42.991 --> 04:46.411
You're already corrupt.
Great, let's just push a little harder.

04:47.078 --> 04:50.456
Dates for sale! Buy some dates!

04:50.540 --> 04:53.251
I'm already having so much fun.
Where do you live?

04:53.918 --> 04:55.086
Where is my money?

04:55.962 --> 04:57.046
My money's gone!

05:05.096 --> 05:06.264
Take this.

05:06.931 --> 05:08.057
Eat this.

05:14.397 --> 05:18.609
I got very lucky today.

05:19.652 --> 05:20.778
Please eat.

05:22.113 --> 05:23.031
Thank you.

05:30.705 --> 05:31.581
Be careful.

05:31.664 --> 05:34.876
Don't touch me, you filthy slave girl.

05:41.382 --> 05:43.426
I can't hear any of those words.

05:45.011 --> 05:46.346
It's all so difficult.

05:48.264 --> 05:49.891
I can't understand a word.

06:19.629 --> 06:20.546
My goodness!

06:24.759 --> 06:25.593
You live here?

06:27.470 --> 06:29.263
How did you find your way here?

06:29.347 --> 06:32.100
Go away. I'll get cast out if anyone sees.

06:32.183 --> 06:34.102
Don't worry. Only you can see me.

06:35.812 --> 06:38.439
Besides, no one
seems to care about you at all.

06:43.611 --> 06:45.488
Humans sure are shallow, aren't they?

06:45.571 --> 06:48.950
They'll ostracize and judge you
even if you're just a tad bit different.

06:49.700 --> 06:50.785
Don't bad-mouth them.

06:51.411 --> 06:54.038
They gave me work to do
and a place to sleep.

06:55.164 --> 06:57.583
Just hurry and get out of here
before you get caught.

06:58.084 --> 06:59.293
I'm just intrigued.

06:59.377 --> 07:02.422
A human who used
all her wishes for others.

07:02.505 --> 07:05.633
One who even dared
to mention me in her final wish.

07:09.929 --> 07:11.013
Wow.

07:11.639 --> 07:13.641
That's what my punishment was!

07:13.724 --> 07:16.644
With no humans to corrupt for 20 years,
I almost died of boredom.

07:16.727 --> 07:18.312
That was my punishment!

07:18.396 --> 07:20.273
You lived, so I never found a new master!

07:20.356 --> 07:21.649
What are you talking about?

07:22.233 --> 07:23.776
I told you I've never made wishes.

07:24.735 --> 07:26.529
Well, well, playing dumb, are we?

07:26.612 --> 07:29.323
You're in this foreign land
with that face of a foreigner.

07:29.407 --> 07:33.161
You may act resolute now, but you will
eventually show your true colors.

07:33.244 --> 07:35.204
Then you'll be corrupt in no time.

07:40.334 --> 07:43.004
Did you say only I can see you?

07:44.130 --> 07:45.047
Yes.

07:46.382 --> 07:47.800
It's one of my main magical…

07:50.261 --> 07:51.971
But why aren't you surprised?

07:52.513 --> 07:53.723
Most humans are.

07:55.516 --> 07:58.603
You said you're a ji-ne.
We have centipedes in Goryeo too.

07:59.729 --> 08:03.483
The elders said that a thousand-year-old
centipede could wield magic.

08:04.066 --> 08:06.110
I'm a genie, not a ji-ne.

08:08.821 --> 08:11.073
So why did you ask
if only you could see me?

08:13.242 --> 08:14.619
It just seems like a shame.

08:18.998 --> 08:22.251
You're so striking when you smile.

08:37.934 --> 08:39.185
"Striking"?

08:39.268 --> 08:41.729
That must be
the highest of compliments in Goryeo.

09:00.456 --> 09:01.999
Why did you come here?

09:02.667 --> 09:05.002
Why else would I come to a camel market?

09:05.670 --> 09:06.796
I'm here to buy a camel.

09:06.879 --> 09:08.297
Why are you buying a camel?

09:08.381 --> 09:09.674
So I can return

09:10.466 --> 09:11.300
to Goryeo.

09:14.679 --> 09:18.516
Are you looking for a camel?
All the good ones are over there.

09:21.602 --> 09:23.104
Stay here and don't interfere.

09:31.195 --> 09:35.157
No! My gold coins! No!

09:48.754 --> 09:49.630
Stop!

10:05.896 --> 10:07.398
It's Shaytan! The Devil!

10:08.149 --> 10:08.983
It's Shaytan!

10:17.908 --> 10:18.868
Here.

10:20.119 --> 10:24.290
You… really are Shaytan.

10:26.959 --> 10:29.587
How could you kill a person?

10:32.381 --> 10:33.466
He took your coins.

10:34.508 --> 10:35.760
This only happened

10:36.886 --> 10:40.431
because I was being
too greedy in the first place.

10:41.974 --> 10:45.227
I was paid too much for the dates.

10:49.815 --> 10:52.151
I never want to see you again.

11:36.904 --> 11:39.240
I returned the coins
to their original owner.

11:39.824 --> 11:42.034
And that jerk really did deserve to die.

11:42.535 --> 11:45.746
You weren't the only one he wronged.
I'm sure the other humans would be

11:46.747 --> 11:47.581
happy.

11:48.374 --> 11:49.208
Probably.

11:50.626 --> 11:54.338
Hey, what am I supposed to do
when that's how I am? I'm Shaytan.

11:57.883 --> 11:59.427
When will you be

12:00.219 --> 12:01.220
going to Goryeo?

12:03.264 --> 12:06.058
Perhaps it would be faster
to cross the Gobi Desert.

12:09.478 --> 12:10.479
Want me to take you?

12:18.320 --> 12:19.405
Do you

12:20.990 --> 12:21.824
know the way?

12:22.533 --> 12:23.492
Somewhat.

12:24.326 --> 12:25.911
I once blocked the path.

12:26.871 --> 12:28.706
I'll find out, so stop being mad.

12:28.789 --> 12:30.166
Really?

12:32.084 --> 12:35.880
Then I'll start saving for a camel again.

12:36.464 --> 12:38.674
Please show me the way.

12:56.192 --> 12:59.445
Why do you live like this anyway?
Doesn't it make you angry?

13:02.031 --> 13:03.616
I died and came back to life,

13:04.283 --> 13:05.701
though I don't remember it.

13:07.578 --> 13:10.623
I must have gained
the scars on my body then.

13:12.917 --> 13:16.545
There must be a reason
I was kept alive in this world.

13:18.088 --> 13:20.216
And so, I should live life to the fullest.

13:50.871 --> 13:51.956
How foolish.

13:52.039 --> 13:54.124
There's no such thing as the right wish.

13:54.875 --> 13:57.378
To gain something,
something else must be lost.

13:57.461 --> 14:00.339
For someone to live, another must die.

14:01.340 --> 14:02.675
Sade!

14:59.940 --> 15:00.774
Khalid.

15:05.446 --> 15:08.824
I bought this from a Khitan merchant.

15:09.533 --> 15:13.078
He told me it was good for coughs.

15:13.162 --> 15:15.664
Boil it and drink the water.

15:18.542 --> 15:20.669
So you care for all the young and old?

15:21.253 --> 15:22.129
Don't.

15:22.630 --> 15:25.591
Humans betray those closest to them
and never learn gratitude.

15:28.552 --> 15:30.095
Isn't that right?

15:30.596 --> 15:33.974
I see you are half human and half spirit.

15:35.643 --> 15:37.269
Apparently, his father sings.

15:38.187 --> 15:39.563
Are you Shadi's son?

15:40.773 --> 15:44.485
You are sick and weak
because you were born with a human body.

15:48.405 --> 15:50.199
You're Iblis, aren't you?

15:50.824 --> 15:55.746
Are you not the leader of spirits?
Could you please make me better?

15:55.829 --> 15:57.748
Please make me a complete spirit.

15:58.332 --> 16:00.125
I know you can do anything.

16:07.091 --> 16:09.635
This thread can bind spirits.

16:09.718 --> 16:12.888
I will gladly
give this to you as an offering.

16:13.430 --> 16:14.598
I don't need it.

16:15.849 --> 16:20.312
We may be related,
but I simply cannot fulfill your request.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.398
Let's go.

16:59.643 --> 17:02.563
Hey, lie down to sleep.
Why are you sleeping like this?

17:04.064 --> 17:06.608
I told you to let me know
before showing up.

17:07.109 --> 17:09.486
Hey, how much clearer
could I have let you know…

17:12.197 --> 17:15.784
What are you making every night anyway?
While losing sleep too.

17:15.868 --> 17:17.119
Hanbok.

17:18.579 --> 17:20.330
To wear on my journey back to Goryeo.

17:22.666 --> 17:24.334
But I need to work during the day.

17:27.463 --> 17:29.089
It's dark as night in here.

17:30.215 --> 17:31.341
Follow me.

17:43.270 --> 17:44.563
This is where you live?

17:45.064 --> 17:48.025
Wow, it's like a palace.

17:48.525 --> 17:49.985
You've never been in a palace.

17:51.236 --> 17:54.198
Hey. I'm from Gaegyeong.

17:54.281 --> 17:57.284
There are so many
magnificent palaces there.

17:57.951 --> 18:01.497
Just standing at the gates
and seeing them from a distance, you know?

18:02.748 --> 18:04.958
Their presence is just, you know?

18:05.042 --> 18:06.710
So you've never been inside.

18:07.753 --> 18:10.255
I got close enough
to be practically inside.

18:10.339 --> 18:11.673
What else is there?

18:12.716 --> 18:14.301
How does it differ from here?

18:19.056 --> 18:20.307
Goryeo has

18:21.058 --> 18:22.559
four distinct seasons.

18:24.019 --> 18:28.482
The summers are hot like it is here,
but in fall, the leaves change color.

18:29.900 --> 18:32.778
And in winter,
white snow falls from the sky.

18:35.072 --> 18:37.908
When the plum blossoms bloom
through those snowflakes,

18:39.201 --> 18:40.119
it's spring.

18:41.870 --> 18:45.082
And when the plum blossoms wither,

18:45.707 --> 18:47.167
the cherry blossoms bloom.

18:51.463 --> 18:54.007
Cherry blossoms are really pretty.

19:22.953 --> 19:24.496
Back in Goryeo,

19:24.580 --> 19:27.791
we wrote our wishes and sent them out
on boats down small streams.

19:28.458 --> 19:30.502
We believed
that the wishes would come true

19:31.378 --> 19:33.505
if the boat reached the ocean.

19:34.548 --> 19:38.385
Consider it the ocean at night.
How far shall I send them for you?

19:41.513 --> 19:42.764
Far, far away.

19:44.433 --> 19:47.227
Beyond the place
where the land meets the sky.

19:49.104 --> 19:50.230
Far away.

19:53.066 --> 19:54.401
All the way to Goryeo.

20:07.289 --> 20:09.708
What did you write on those boats anyway?

20:11.585 --> 20:12.836
Never you mind.

20:15.505 --> 20:16.548
It looks like

20:17.549 --> 20:20.177
it's raining stars.

20:46.870 --> 20:49.456
PLEASE DO NOT LET THIS WANDERER STARVE

20:52.668 --> 20:55.837
PLEASE DO NOT LET ANYONE FALL VICTIM
TO THIS WANDERER'S STRIKING LOOKS

20:56.588 --> 21:01.510
PLEASE LET ME RETURN TO GORYEO

21:23.240 --> 21:27.160
It is Ejllael!
He has come to take my soul.

21:28.120 --> 21:32.165
I will guide your soul
with these sacred wings.

21:32.749 --> 21:36.003
Did you say you will guide my soul

21:36.586 --> 21:39.298
with those sacred wings of yours?

21:39.381 --> 21:40.716
Your soul will…

21:41.216 --> 21:42.217
Ouch ouchy!

21:42.301 --> 21:45.304
He says my soul will go ouch ouchy!

21:45.804 --> 21:48.598
Ouch ouchy!

21:49.599 --> 21:51.977
Hey, you could just ask nicely!

21:52.060 --> 21:55.522
Why would you just pluck my feathers?

22:01.069 --> 22:06.074
You, who came from Goryeo,
were living as a slave. Serves you right.

22:07.617 --> 22:10.662
They say, in Goryeo,
there is a centipede that wields magic.

22:11.163 --> 22:13.957
I shall go up against it
when I get to Goryeo.

22:16.043 --> 22:17.753
You wish upon stars.

22:22.215 --> 22:26.595
She used up all her wishes on others
and now makes wishes on silly stars.

22:27.596 --> 22:29.306
She even wished for my sake.

22:30.390 --> 22:35.062
To think that she is concerned
for my body and my meals.

22:43.737 --> 22:46.656
Why should a fleeting moment matter
to one who is immortal?

22:47.157 --> 22:50.243
While Iblis was tied
to that girl's final wish…

22:52.245 --> 22:55.207
he was more interested in her
than in corrupting humans.

22:55.791 --> 22:57.918
Strangely, he seemed far more excited

22:58.001 --> 23:00.587
pondering what to feed her
and how to make her smile

23:00.670 --> 23:03.924
than when he was scheming how to corrupt

23:04.424 --> 23:05.884
another human soul.

23:06.718 --> 23:07.719
I know.

23:10.931 --> 23:12.432
It's just so sad, Master.

23:19.856 --> 23:23.610
I'm talking about how much
of a damn fool Iblis was.

23:23.693 --> 23:25.737
What am I to do
if you find this upsetting?

23:26.696 --> 23:28.865
I was too busy crying to see that, Master.

23:28.949 --> 23:30.659
Would you please repeat yourself?

23:33.537 --> 23:34.454
Look carefully.

23:35.497 --> 23:36.748
Get out!

23:52.931 --> 23:55.600
Can't you find us some good clams?

23:56.518 --> 23:59.396
You keep bringing ones
full of these rocks.

24:00.147 --> 24:01.148
Just throw it out.

24:05.527 --> 24:06.486
That's hot.

24:08.738 --> 24:11.783
When will you complete that garment?
The Goryeo one.

24:11.867 --> 24:14.202
It's not easy to find the right fabric.

24:15.370 --> 24:18.331
-But I've almost finished.
-Can't you make it on the way?

24:19.958 --> 24:21.126
Let's leave after eating.

24:23.670 --> 24:26.506
Really? Can we really go now?

24:28.842 --> 24:30.093
What about your lamp?

24:32.971 --> 24:35.849
I'll pray that he hurls it
with all his power to Goryeo.

24:38.268 --> 24:41.730
You who are singular and omnipotent.

24:42.439 --> 24:45.025
You are benevolent and noble.

24:45.901 --> 24:47.444
You are also merciful

24:47.944 --> 24:50.655
and wise, and, well…

24:50.739 --> 24:52.449
You're also…

24:52.532 --> 24:54.659
You look incredibly desperate.

25:03.585 --> 25:05.253
Hey, you're…

25:07.088 --> 25:08.548
You're glowing.

25:09.257 --> 25:11.134
It's a new master. But how?

25:14.471 --> 25:16.056
You were my last master,

25:17.015 --> 25:19.142
and I should still be tied
to your final wish.

25:20.018 --> 25:21.811
How is it I have a new master?

25:21.895 --> 25:24.231
I'm not quite sure,
but isn't this a good thing?

25:24.814 --> 25:28.485
You said you were really bored
with no new master in 20 years.

25:30.195 --> 25:31.321
Maybe you're right.

25:32.697 --> 25:34.699
Well, then, I'll quickly go
and corrupt them.

25:58.598 --> 26:00.934
We meet at last, Iblis.

26:01.017 --> 26:04.479
Because of you,
I have lived the past two decades

26:04.563 --> 26:07.649
as an oppressed foreigner.

26:24.165 --> 26:27.168
It's Iblis! It's Shaytan!

26:28.753 --> 26:32.007
Where are you going?
Cast the Goryeo bitch aside too!

26:33.425 --> 26:34.843
-Run!
-Help!

26:39.723 --> 26:42.517
So it seems I missed one.

26:52.861 --> 26:57.324
I wish to possess more
than anyone born of this land.

26:59.993 --> 27:02.078
So my first wish

27:03.121 --> 27:06.249
is for you to make me
the richest person in the world.

27:13.715 --> 27:16.343
How predictable.

27:17.469 --> 27:20.388
Your wish has been fulfilled.

28:00.428 --> 28:01.262
You called me?

28:01.346 --> 28:04.641
I have decided on my second wish, Genie.

28:05.392 --> 28:09.396
Kill all those who looked down on me.
Let them die in agony.

28:12.399 --> 28:15.568
You really are Shaytan.

28:16.403 --> 28:18.613
How could you kill a person?

28:25.370 --> 28:28.373
Your wish has been fulfilled.

28:46.766 --> 28:50.770
Dates for sale! Buy some dates!

28:51.271 --> 28:54.524
Dates for sale! Buy some dates!

28:55.900 --> 28:57.485
Dates for sale!

29:13.585 --> 29:16.713
Are you…

29:16.796 --> 29:20.842
I got very lucky today.

29:20.925 --> 29:22.135
Please eat.

29:22.761 --> 29:23.928
Thank you.

29:24.012 --> 29:27.348
Yes, it is I. Do you remember me?

29:27.849 --> 29:30.685
You gave me the sweetest of dates.

29:31.644 --> 29:33.605
Now I will give you everything you want.

29:33.688 --> 29:39.736
Garments and precious jewels.
A big house and countless servants.

29:39.819 --> 29:41.237
What do you say?

29:44.699 --> 29:46.701
I do not want anything

29:47.619 --> 29:49.788
I did not earn by my own effort.

29:50.413 --> 29:54.292
And I will soon be leaving
for my hometown.

29:57.754 --> 30:00.089
You don't want it?
And you're leaving, you say?

30:00.173 --> 30:02.759
Now that I am looking down at you,
it is crystal clear.

30:02.842 --> 30:06.262
You are that slave girl
I bought to use as animal feed.

30:06.846 --> 30:09.933
And you dared to take pity on me?

30:17.065 --> 30:18.149
How does it look?

30:23.738 --> 30:24.989
It's beautiful.

30:27.075 --> 30:28.785
I had already finished making it.

30:29.786 --> 30:33.832
But I figured there was a chance
you couldn't leave this place.

30:34.833 --> 30:36.084
Because of the wishes.

30:37.085 --> 30:41.089
I don't know the way,
and I couldn't just leave you behind.

30:48.221 --> 30:49.597
It's Muttalib's final wish.

30:50.723 --> 30:51.724
That means

30:52.308 --> 30:55.478
we really are leaving tonight, right?

30:56.187 --> 30:57.021
For Goryeo.

30:57.105 --> 30:59.065
Yes. Let's go.

31:00.066 --> 31:03.027
I shall go to see
the four seasons of Goryeo,

31:03.695 --> 31:05.864
where spring arrives
when winter snowflakes melt

31:06.531 --> 31:08.491
and the cherry and plum blossoms bloom.

31:09.075 --> 31:11.202
If you can't find me, just call my name.

31:13.079 --> 31:14.706
The name for you to call me

31:15.498 --> 31:16.666
is Iblis.

31:17.792 --> 31:19.127
Iblis.

31:21.462 --> 31:22.589
Is your surname "Lee"?

31:24.883 --> 31:25.884
Is that a good thing?

31:27.176 --> 31:28.386
Let's say it is, then.

31:52.785 --> 31:55.955
So let's hear it. Your final wish.

31:56.039 --> 32:00.126
After claiming revenge
and wealth beyond measure,

32:00.209 --> 32:05.590
I have found
that some things remain priceless.

32:05.673 --> 32:08.343
My last wish is her complete submission.

32:09.052 --> 32:12.805
Make that bitch stay by my side
for the rest of her life.

32:22.315 --> 32:25.276
Your wish has been fulfilled.

32:27.195 --> 32:31.574
A heart that won't bow
for all the gold in the world?

32:31.658 --> 32:33.326
I'd like to see who this is.

32:49.133 --> 32:50.259
Why are you…

32:54.639 --> 32:55.765
Why are you here?

32:55.848 --> 32:57.976
Why the hell are you here?

32:58.059 --> 33:01.229
I see. You have come crawling back!

33:01.729 --> 33:04.524
Of course, who could resist
all the world's riches?

33:05.024 --> 33:08.152
Bring her to me right now!

33:18.371 --> 33:19.998
Why is Shaytan…

33:25.086 --> 33:27.463
Stop him! Stop Shaytan!

33:36.681 --> 33:40.435
What is this thing?
Take it off! Take it off me right now!

33:48.234 --> 33:51.779
Since you refused my kindness,
I am proving my thread's worth.

33:53.197 --> 33:54.240
This is my thread's…

33:56.659 --> 33:57.535
use and power.

34:22.185 --> 34:24.228
Hunbish?

34:26.189 --> 34:27.690
You're still alive?

34:30.985 --> 34:34.280
So the boy who owned this body
was named Hunbish?

34:40.995 --> 34:42.038
Khalid.

34:46.793 --> 34:48.169
You're Khalid.

34:53.841 --> 34:54.926
How come you're…

34:55.426 --> 34:56.385
How can this be?

34:58.763 --> 35:01.516
Look! I've bound Shaytan!

35:02.141 --> 35:05.603
And this foreign girl loves another man.

35:05.686 --> 35:06.813
She loves Shaytan!

35:08.523 --> 35:09.524
What?

35:09.607 --> 35:11.400
You didn't come for me.

35:11.484 --> 35:13.361
You came for him!

35:15.947 --> 35:17.698
Get the bitch to her feet!

35:19.325 --> 35:20.326
Let go of me.

35:20.409 --> 35:21.953
Let go!

35:26.707 --> 35:30.294
Make that bitch stay by my side
for the rest of her life.

35:33.297 --> 35:35.883
So this was the wish that I granted.

35:36.884 --> 35:37.885
No.

35:43.099 --> 35:44.809
I'm coming. I'll come to you.

35:46.435 --> 35:49.730
If I can't have her, no one can!

35:56.737 --> 35:57.572
No!

36:03.369 --> 36:04.537
No!

36:14.964 --> 36:15.965
I'm coming.

36:20.469 --> 36:22.388
No.

36:23.222 --> 36:24.515
Please, you can't.

36:35.818 --> 36:36.903
In Goryeo…

36:39.947 --> 36:40.907
No.

36:45.369 --> 36:48.164
Everyone has four lives.

36:51.834 --> 36:53.419
Whichever life it may be…

36:57.048 --> 37:00.009
come and visit me in one of them.

37:01.177 --> 37:03.971
No, please. Just hang in there. Wait.

37:04.555 --> 37:05.640
Just hold on.

37:13.272 --> 37:15.816
I am Genie, the lamp spirit.

37:15.900 --> 37:19.862
I shall grant you three wishes.

37:19.946 --> 37:24.951
Please, I request any of you
to become my master

37:25.034 --> 37:30.831
and use one of your wishes
to save this girl.

37:32.792 --> 37:34.126
I beg you!

37:34.877 --> 37:38.297
Whatever it is you desire,

37:38.923 --> 37:43.344
I will fulfill
your second and third wishes.

37:59.860 --> 38:01.445
I will do it.

38:04.657 --> 38:07.118
Make me the richest man in the world.

38:07.201 --> 38:08.160
Richer than Muttalib!

38:09.829 --> 38:10.663
Please, no.

38:22.466 --> 38:24.760
All right. Now, please.

38:25.303 --> 38:28.347
Before this girl takes her last breath…

38:30.349 --> 38:32.935
Please!

38:33.936 --> 38:36.939
It works. It really works!

38:37.023 --> 38:39.025
-But this is not enough.
-No.

38:39.525 --> 38:42.153
I want more gold. More!

38:42.236 --> 38:45.197
No, this can't be.

38:53.998 --> 38:57.209
Please. This is your final wish.

38:57.710 --> 39:01.255
Please use your last wish
to save this girl.

39:05.092 --> 39:07.928
Please!

39:13.392 --> 39:15.603
I want more gold, Genie.

39:15.686 --> 39:18.439
Fill this entire city with gold!

39:20.107 --> 39:24.362
No, this can't be. Please.

39:24.445 --> 39:25.780
We want gold too!

39:25.863 --> 39:27.323
Shower us with gold!

39:27.406 --> 39:28.532
This can't be.

39:37.458 --> 39:38.667
I'm sorry…

39:41.295 --> 39:44.090
for leaving you all alone.

39:59.355 --> 40:01.982
No!

40:02.066 --> 40:04.819
This can't be! No, please!

40:04.902 --> 40:06.362
Please, no!

40:07.655 --> 40:08.656
No!

40:23.087 --> 40:27.967
No, this can't be!

40:28.592 --> 40:30.803
This can't be. Bring her back!

40:30.886 --> 40:34.348
Bring her back now! Please!

40:43.941 --> 40:44.859
No!

44:14.193 --> 44:18.614
Do you realize now how arrogant you were?

44:20.699 --> 44:21.950
At long last…

44:25.287 --> 44:26.705
that girl's

44:28.207 --> 44:29.541
final wish…

44:32.086 --> 44:33.212
was fulfilled.

44:39.343 --> 44:40.469
This…

44:44.598 --> 44:46.308
was my punishment.

44:48.102 --> 44:52.189
I was almost sentenced to an eternal life,

44:52.272 --> 44:55.734
but thankfully,
faced death in another body.

44:56.568 --> 44:58.404
Then I became a wandering soul

44:59.279 --> 45:02.491
until I found you and my sister.

45:03.617 --> 45:07.037
Your punishment
has not yet come to an end,

45:07.121 --> 45:10.082
and you two are bound,
even in this life, by three wishes.

45:15.587 --> 45:16.547
That was…

45:19.007 --> 45:20.592
That was my doing yet again.

45:20.676 --> 45:27.057
And so, I return
this sad and beautiful story to you.

45:27.141 --> 45:30.644
Let your punishment for saving me be this.

45:31.979 --> 45:35.607
Whatever her final wish may be,
protect her,

45:35.691 --> 45:39.403
the one who was born to be wicked
yet still remains righteous.

45:46.618 --> 45:48.287
It is well overdue, but I apologize.

45:49.371 --> 45:53.459
You were also one of the more
admirable humans that I've ever met.

45:54.585 --> 45:55.961
May your soul…

45:58.672 --> 46:00.090
find its way to peace.

47:22.840 --> 47:26.468
Whatever the punishment, I will take it.

47:28.428 --> 47:30.305
I will accept it willingly.

47:31.598 --> 47:32.766
I hope with all I have.

47:34.935 --> 47:38.397
Deliver whatever punishment
you see fit for my arrogance.

47:39.731 --> 47:41.275
I hope and plead.

47:42.276 --> 47:43.861
Of all I possess,

47:44.778 --> 47:47.573
take away anything
you see as more than I deserve.

47:49.324 --> 47:51.034
I hope against hope.

47:52.160 --> 47:53.287
Just once.

47:54.913 --> 47:56.290
Please, just once.

47:58.083 --> 48:00.294
Allow me to visit one of her lives.

48:02.296 --> 48:04.256
Deliver whatever punishment you must,

48:05.257 --> 48:07.175
and take away whatever you must.

48:09.011 --> 48:10.304
But just once…

48:12.264 --> 48:15.517
Please, just once,
in whichever of her lives…

48:19.521 --> 48:22.774
Whatever the punishment, I will take it.

48:24.776 --> 48:27.070
I will accept it willingly.

48:29.239 --> 48:34.745
Deliver whatever punishment
you see fit for my arrogance.

48:36.371 --> 48:38.081
Of all I possess…

49:02.814 --> 49:05.859
What are you saying? Pan-geum came where?

49:05.943 --> 49:07.444
She didn't come from anywhere.

49:07.527 --> 49:09.613
She never went to Hawaii
in the first place!

49:11.073 --> 49:12.991
Yes, is that you, Chang-sik?

49:13.075 --> 49:15.327
Hurry over to Pan-geum's house!

49:15.410 --> 49:17.162
Just come when I tell you to!

49:19.414 --> 49:20.499
Follow me!

49:20.582 --> 49:22.542
-What is going on?
-Where are we going?

49:22.626 --> 49:25.629
Oh my! What happened?
What's all the fuss about?

49:41.269 --> 49:42.729
-Welcome.
-Welcome.

49:43.981 --> 49:44.815
Grand…

49:45.649 --> 49:46.483
Mi-ju.

49:47.859 --> 49:49.695
What is it? Why are you crying?

49:51.530 --> 49:52.823
Has something happened?

49:57.786 --> 50:01.581
My wisdom tooth just hurts so much.

50:12.551 --> 50:13.802
I'll take a look at her.

50:27.607 --> 50:29.109
You absolute witch!

50:29.901 --> 50:30.902
Mrs. Park.

50:30.986 --> 50:31.903
Mrs. Park!

50:31.987 --> 50:33.989
Hey! Where have you run off to?

50:34.072 --> 50:36.033
Oh Pan-geum! Come out here right now!

50:36.116 --> 50:38.994
If you have nothing to hide,
come out this instant and say so!

50:39.703 --> 50:41.204
Heung-rye, please.

50:41.288 --> 50:42.664
Goodness me!

50:42.748 --> 50:45.083
What in the world
did you sacrifice to get that way?

50:45.167 --> 50:48.336
What in the world did you sacrifice
to get so young all on your own?

50:48.420 --> 50:49.629
-Come on.
-Mrs. Park!

50:49.713 --> 50:51.673
Nobody's even home!
What's gotten into you?

50:51.757 --> 50:54.718
-Let go of me!
-Please just try to calm down!

50:54.801 --> 50:55.635
Let go of me!

50:55.719 --> 50:59.222
I'm telling you, Oh Pan-geum
must be using witchcraft or something

50:59.306 --> 51:01.516
because she's become
a young lady. You hear?

51:01.600 --> 51:04.853
Hey! I want to be young again too!
Me too, okay?

51:04.936 --> 51:07.105
-No one's getting younger!
-Get out of there.

51:07.189 --> 51:09.149
-Let go of me!
-You're not making any sense.

51:09.232 --> 51:12.194
Deacon An, just stay back.
Please, it's dangerous.

51:12.778 --> 51:15.280
Deacon? Is there even a god?

51:15.906 --> 51:20.327
If there is, there is no way
that he would let me become so miserable!

51:20.410 --> 51:23.580
My old age makes me miserable!

51:23.663 --> 51:27.292
Goodness me, I got so damn old
in the blink of an eye!

51:27.375 --> 51:30.921
Lord have mercy!

51:32.172 --> 51:34.716
Right, this bitch. That's where she'll be.

51:34.800 --> 51:36.510
-The fields!
-Where are you going now?

51:42.265 --> 51:43.350
Don't get out.

51:44.309 --> 51:47.395
-I'll deal with the witch myself!
-Chang-sik, please get up!

51:47.479 --> 51:49.022
She'll be in the onion field!

51:49.106 --> 51:50.357
You'll get yourself hurt!

51:50.899 --> 51:53.443
Calm down. Please calm down!

51:53.944 --> 51:58.031
Pan-geum is in Hawaii.
Why would she be in the onion field?

51:58.115 --> 51:59.116
Shut up!

52:13.922 --> 52:14.840
Heung-rye.

52:32.858 --> 52:35.861
You damn bastard! Get out!

52:36.736 --> 52:37.737
Get out of the car!

52:39.281 --> 52:40.574
-Get out!
-Get out!

52:41.158 --> 52:42.117
Get out of the car!

52:42.200 --> 52:43.869
What the hell are you doing, punk?

52:43.952 --> 52:44.995
Get out--

52:49.040 --> 52:50.292
Is this the police?

52:52.085 --> 52:53.378
I've just run someone over.

52:54.421 --> 52:57.382
Ishrun. You know what to do, right?

52:57.465 --> 52:59.301
I think she's dead.

53:00.093 --> 53:01.344
We're just outside

53:02.804 --> 53:04.431
Ms. Ki Ka-young's house.

56:36.976 --> 56:41.981
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
